# storePassword=YOUR_STORE_PASSWORD_HERE
# keyPassword=YOUR_KEY_PASSWORD_HERE
# keyAlias=doc_appoint_release
# storeFile=/absolute/path/to/doc_appoint_release.jks

# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Generate a release keystore using keytool (see ANDROID_SIGNING_SETUP.md)
# 2. Fill in the values above with your actual keystore credentials
# 3. Make sure storeFile is an absolute path to your keystore file
# 4. This file is in .gitignore and must NEVER be committed to version control
# 5. For CI/CD, these values should be injected as environment variables
